 greatest metal icon, by defeating Death himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Inventory Strategy:</strong> A unique 12-slot gear system where positioning matters and synergies reign.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Drawn Hellscapes:</strong> Stylish, animated characters and effects bring the underworld to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face the Iconic:</strong> Take on powerful bosses, including the ultimate metal singer: Death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Runs:</strong> Immerse yourself in rapid, intense underworld battles. Test your skills and survival instincts in action-packed showdowns, ensuring you're always on the edge of your seat.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Rogueside"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461800/5d483be008867506f2ee03831189dbb9d8b87815/header.jpg?t=1770200729","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright Rogueside NV","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 13 Ventura<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  GeForce GTX 470<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3461800/456251886/3b83b89481ed46f902d59528a8dea8f02859243a/1768554551/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768564844","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/